  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P03_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Что это?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1200,
      "sha256": "7ec41ab2b69f348c3481658d139b59f07aaf45c4e86f9a8e59be2952be66ce8a"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P03_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Это центральный архив. Настрой его под себя — и он выдаст всю необходимую информацию.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "sha256": "96473e0658ed92dd53eeabb636a146e49c77dc573e216128a46b450462453153"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P03_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Мика начал настраивать архив. Над пультом замелькали странные изображения, и зазвучал голос.",
      "emotion_tag": "[narrating]",
      "duration_ms": 6640,
      "sha256": "02457b5fbc384f3f49240f516c334745ca1ccb5b253152a85b1cb5efe2b846da"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P03_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Когда-то мы выглядели немного иначе и жили в другом мире.",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "sha256": "f63ded7683823b684fa0541de3fbb6d881d92697a670f445f7373b51df6db31a"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P03_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Но нас тоже настиг шторм. Нам пришлось эвакуироваться.",
      "emotion_tag": "[somber]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "sha256": "69d45c3ea81a77b62e10ed4c90caeea23933ccbd38efd983e9bbd33be0218d15"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P03_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "К тому времени мы уже изучили гравитационные аномалии и научились проходить сквозь них. Так мы смогли покинуть прежний мир.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 7840,
      "sha256": "c45d38edda133a703b20e75a7669bfd2e27a04a1be3c893f8ad73b05403d9a2b"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P03_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "What is this?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1520,
      "sha256": "1edd7cca9cd212d5b85dfb03f32464ac80c5e2486ead78c72ec5e37e9d57c6ce"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P03_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "This is the Central Archive. Set it up for yourself, and it will give you everything you need to know.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5920,
      "sha256": "799d77d9a1da79f8def5d55328a87adf21cef23cca616fcb614b1a7ed2b1a97e"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P03_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika began setting up the archive. Strange images flickered above the controls, and a voice began to speak.",
      "emotion_tag": "[narrating]",
      "duration_ms": 7280,
      "sha256": "eeb84e3a4bafb55410ce039b44aa5e46a170d959a3bfb19b931e8de09d2b06b8"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P03_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "We once looked a little different and lived in another world.",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "bf0cc00f69ada533baa215fbeee2c08c26d8aee4e67b4bf883acdf4091d6af75"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P03_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "But the storm reached us, too. We had to evacuate.",
      "emotion_tag": "[somber]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "d44e7786bff5e6809dd93a5a138d468a65bf48786d39119c2a2999b41b95e68a"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P03_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "By then, we had studied gravitational anomalies and learned to travel through them. That was how we left our old world.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 7200,
      "sha256": "5899c3915b7b8ea743bf1f5cb33666783d8d969bc6be8501a95ef8d09feee818"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P03_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "O que é isso?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "e8b13bfea30c87f8b8eed1de5b4e39420a761442f293d01d6a38d09ab0cf3357"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P03_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Este é o Arquivo Central. Configure-o do seu jeito e ele mostrará tudo o que você precisa saber.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 6080,
      "sha256": "960765ff084eb07a8993058274279c7be8048e08a46e8ccf5f12ea8acfe67789"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P03_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika começou a configurar o arquivo. Imagens estranhas surgiram sobre o painel, e uma voz começou a falar.",
      "emotion_tag": "[narrating]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "f460c4a6b788420aa5fddcb1ddbf1164f2f3f9adcc6f07573a2bfc8ea854c6b1"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P03_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Antigamente, éramos um pouco diferentes e vivíamos em outro mundo.",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "18390313b0aec1d31c887cfc55421238f7bb65965a7969cfb3f242f142ab0f5a"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P03_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Mas a tempestade também nos alcançou. Tivemos que fugir.",
      "emotion_tag": "[somber]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "sha256": "0b6ce39efb95c0c2c1e63615a01db415317fa752e3dd3af4676df338e0259ddb"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P03_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Naquela época, já estudávamos anomalias gravitacionais e sabíamos atravessá-las. Foi assim que deixamos nosso antigo mundo.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 7840,
      "sha256": "0e87d8698d2cc15a417a906b4cdd3a8f0c50059750b0639ab263ce775dfe2b68"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P03_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "¿Qué es esto?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1200,
      "sha256": "7e3c705e5bfd6bddc258d1e0656f58e2d31abc080ecf3d59753045cbaa663870"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P03_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Este es el Archivo Central. Ajústalo a tu medida y te dará toda la información que necesites.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 6080,
      "sha256": "6a12178e1368a4cce5e7c656b920a089f66307e10a1cc1115b8be3bb8c8b6f9a"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P03_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika comenzó a configurar el archivo. Sobre el panel aparecieron imágenes extrañas y empezó a sonar una voz.",
      "emotion_tag": "[narrating]",
      "duration_ms": 7280,
      "sha256": "f41e07a23a1bd5f8b5859bd1a4d15bb6f9322b572fdb0a0c022721ef8be8e3b0"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P03_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Hace tiempo teníamos un aspecto algo distinto y vivíamos en otro mundo.",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "38d2aa730c5f287de1ef52520f79230c6be3b710fc219b352570e6fff971f089"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P03_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Pero la tormenta también llegó hasta nosotros. Tuvimos que evacuar.",
      "emotion_tag": "[somber]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "sha256": "453ec2964c610c4b34f319392a1faa0cdee705cdd54ad189054f22e294110467"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P03_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Por entonces ya habíamos estudiado las anomalías gravitatorias y aprendido a atravesarlas. Así pudimos dejar nuestro antiguo mundo.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 8080,
      "sha256": "2d103c6944b50bf59a82c7f9ae54a32bf53ebc0814ab08e1355119eb06fe0dc3"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P03_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Qu’est-ce que c’est ?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1120,
      "sha256": "480808d784a5f88851d790605cfd69974403b1725a817bb37bb632c326e1608d"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P03_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Voici les Archives centrales. Personnalise-les, et elles te donneront toutes les informations dont tu as besoin.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "sha256": "ca0021b2f2cb0a4736ab42e2b463189e82eb1b522cace027ec5570bf06f102a0"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P03_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika commença à régler les archives. D’étranges images surgirent au-dessus du pupitre, puis une voix retentit.",
      "emotion_tag": "[narrating]",
      "duration_ms": 7280,
      "sha256": "e66eee26010af3693a3c54a3c1b22afb739a7b86a15659a6cd247bb78d84e603"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P03_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Autrefois, nous avions un aspect un peu différent et vivions dans un autre monde.",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "b2c60169ba126eab597bbf7baec3d7d24c13b0c7af616a66b777a593221affc8"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P03_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Mais la tempête nous a rattrapés, nous aussi. Nous avons dû évacuer.",
      "emotion_tag": "[somber]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "sha256": "a726855ea994f0cfc87be76760750c72bb6c536fb6d3fbb10ddb8a3d52d8a6d7"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P03_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "À cette époque, nous avions déjà étudié les anomalies gravitationnelles et appris à les traverser. C’est ainsi que nous avons quitté notre ancien monde.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 7920,
      "sha256": "6433dd962fafe74677c01d297f9ab89eb2e9e8535058d83eb0f5b45f8d394a44"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P03_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Was ist das?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1440,
      "sha256": "b9ef7a16ca4049e664a8168fd8f0a796a22a52b64d5444c4d7f3fb7cd08d44a7"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P03_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Das ist das Zentralarchiv. Richte es für dich ein, dann liefert es dir alle Informationen, die du brauchst.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "sha256": "b2174a9f689b12beda69ba22c16a399feb41145f591dc0e3a3d947931d7ababb"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P03_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika begann, das Archiv einzustellen. Über dem Pult erschienen seltsame Bilder, und eine Stimme erklang.",
      "emotion_tag": "[narrating]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "sha256": "19bd441e8eba07d72e398bd39c0fc40ebf1f8fdad4a12b693d5e697443139ba9"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P03_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Früher sahen wir etwas anders aus und lebten in einer anderen Welt.",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "sha256": "9bb9b7b0843f5c5ce9e4e120dff24b530f78f1d1a2791fa2f667657e031206ab"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P03_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Doch der Sturm erreichte auch uns. Wir mussten fliehen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[somber]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "451450057a211043ff3e48b3ec27529250e86babf731e7a656e4168c6c6c89b9"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P03_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P03_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Damals hatten wir Gravitationsanomalien bereits erforscht und gelernt, sie zu durchqueren. So konnten wir unsere alte Welt verlassen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 7440,
